to-be-incorporated-into-paper-146 : List Word
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-146 = unlines (cons "In hyperactivity's language as the repository implements it: **Composition.** `comp A u a0` takes a line of types `A(i)`, a starting element `a0 : A(0)` and a" (cons "partial value `u` (where it is given, what the result must be along the line), and produces an" (cons "element of `A(1)` matching `u`. Transport is composition with nothing given. How it is computed" (cons "depends on what kind of type `A(i)` is; each case is a term in `lib/prelude.cub`, not C:" (cons "- functions (`%comp-pi`): to apply the result to `x : A(1)`, move `x` back to each `A(i)`, apply," (cons "  and compose the results in the codomain;" (cons "- pairs (`%comp-sigma`): compose the first components, then the second components along the line" (cons "  the first one traced;" (cons "- paths (`%comp-path`): compose pointwise, adding the path's two endpoints to what is given;" (cons "- Glue (`%comp-glue`): this is where univalence computes, so transport along `ua e` applies `e`;" (cons "  on the end's faces the fibre over the composed base comes from the equivalence's contractibility;" (cons "- universes (`%comp-u`): a composition of types is a type of its own, `%hcompU A S` (Cubical Agda's" (cons "  `hcomp` in `Type`). Its faces `S` are the tube's lines of types from `A`, and the complement of" (cons "  the tube's face carries `A` itself, so where the tube is empty the composition is `A` and a" (cons "  closed composition of types is a type. Its elements are `glue` values; on a face, `%unglueU`" (cons "  transports back along that face's line. Composition through it (`%comp-gluel`) composes the" (cons "  unglued base and then, on the end's faces, takes the fibre of that transport over it from" (cons "  `%tproof`: the transport fillers along the line and one composition back along it. No" (cons "  equivalence and no contractibility proof is involved, so eliminating a higher inductive type" (cons "  into the universe and transporting through the result costs transports along the face lines," (cons "  at every nesting depth." nil)))))))))))))))))))))
